cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Learning in research, teaching or a report, please cite it like this."
type: software
title: "Learning: a self-hosted learning platform for Nextcloud (spaced repetition, exam simulator, signed certificates)"
abstract: >-
  Nextcloud app for flashcards with spaced repetition (Leitner system or FSRS-5),
  timed exam simulation with presets, nine interactive IT simulators, story campaigns
  from real incidents, instructor analytics, mandatory-training and recertification
  workflows, and Ed25519-signed completion certificates with a public verification
  portal. Optional AI tutor with per-user consent. All data stays on the operator's server.
authors:
